   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>I</strong>nstall: Mall</p>\n<p><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 3 (1d6)</p>\n<p><em>A pair of cyberfingers with a scalpel and precision tweezers.</em></p>\n<p>Cyberfinger. Requires a Modular Finger Cyberhand. Comes with a small set of surgical tools, and functions as an Excellent Quality Light Melee Weapon. A Medtech using a pair of Medtool Cyberfingers gains a +1 bonus to Surgery Checks that does not stack with a MicroWaldo.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Cyberarm<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Mall<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cyberware items have no Quality field, so the Excellent Quality is in the text only.</li>\n<li>The +1 Surgery is situational because it needs a pair and a Medtech: tick it in the roll dialog.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberarms).</em></p>"
